    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Chi Ninja, the fast-paced game that will test your ninja skills and reflexes like never before!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a world full of ninjas, our hero must fight his way to freedom using his sharp ninja moves, grappling hook, and ninja stars, as well as his trusty katana. With challenging levels that will put your skills to the test, you\u2019ll have to dodge traps, avoid enemies, and use your ninja abilities to reach the end of each level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be warned, the ninja army is not to be underestimated! You\u2019ll face waves of enemies that will test your combat skills, and you\u2019ll need to use all of your ninja abilities to defeat them. You\u2019ll need to be at the top of your game to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut it\u2019s not just about fighting - Chi Ninja also features a range of other challenges that will test your agility and reflexes. You\u2019ll need to use your grappling hook <br />\r\n to reach places , wall jump your way to new heights, and slide under obstacles to make your way through the levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith its stylish visuals and fast-paced gameplay, Chi Ninja is the ultimate ninja experience. Do you have what it takes to fight your way to freedom? Play Chi Ninja on Steam today and find out!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Chi Ninja, the fast-paced game that will test your ninja skills and reflexes like never before!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a world full of ninjas, our hero must fight his way to freedom using his sharp ninja moves, grappling hook, and ninja stars, as well as his trusty katana. With challenging levels that will put your skills to the test, you\u2019ll have to dodge traps, avoid enemies, and use your ninja abilities to reach the end of each level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be warned, the ninja army is not to be underestimated! You\u2019ll face waves of enemies that will test your combat skills, and you\u2019ll need to use all of your ninja abilities to defeat them. You\u2019ll need to be at the top of your game to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut it\u2019s not just about fighting - Chi Ninja also features a range of other challenges that will test your agility and reflexes. You\u2019ll need to use your grappling hook <br />\r\n to reach places , wall jump your way to new heights, and slide under obstacles to make your way through the levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith its stylish visuals and fast-paced gameplay, Chi Ninja is the ultimate ninja experience. Do you have what it takes to fight your way to freedom? Play Chi Ninja on Steam today and find out!",
    "short_description": "In a world full of ninjas chi ninja will fight his way to freedom a fast pace speed runner platformer with sharp ninja moves grappling hock and ninja stars aswell as a katana will our hero survive the ninja army.",
